# Build context for the API image (Dockerfile). Phase 11 (Constitution 4 §141/§142, audit E8): secrets, keys, scratch
# and test fixtures never enter the context — so they can never be COPY'd into a layer by accident.
**/node_modules
**/dist
.git
.github
.gitignore
*.md
/mnt
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
# transcripts / local artifacts that must never enter an image
*.zip
# secrets and key material
.env*
**/.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.crt
**/id_rsa*
**/.npmrc
**/secrets
# Security Deep Scan A11: mobile signing / platform key material never enters an image either
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/key.properties
**/*.p8
**/*.mobileprovision
**/google-services.json
**/GoogleService-Info.plist
**/*service-account*.json
**/firebase-admin*.json
# local data written at runtime (local-disk media, private support attachments) — never baked into an image
apps/api/media
apps/api/private-attachments
**/uploads
# tests, fixtures, coverage, scratch
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.spec.tsx
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/coverage
**/__fixtures__
**/fixtures
**/scratch
**/tmp
**/.vitest-cache
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
# IaC and editor state (not part of the API image)
deploy/terraform/.terraform
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
.vscode
.idea
